== Icelandic ==
{{Is-Numeral(þrír)|tuttugu og }}
===Etymology===
From ''[[tuttugu]]'' meaning "[[twenty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[þrír]]'' "[[three]]". Meaning '''twenty and three'''.

=== Cardinal number ===

'''tuttugu og þrír''' {{indecl}}

# [[twenty-three]], cardinal number after [[tuttugu og tveir]] and before [[tuttugu og fjórir]]

